@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Method / document navigation. Scope-independent process/navigation; provider or runner examples are not MVP prerequisites.
title Resumefolio | Requirements working cycle
skinparam backgroundColor #101827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F1F5F9
skinparam hyperlinkColor #A9D0FF
skinparam dpi 216
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #9FB2CD
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #1C3453
  BorderColor #9FB2CD
  FontColor #F1F5F9
  DiamondBackgroundColor #49351C
  DiamondBorderColor #F2BA72
  StartColor #F1F5F9
  EndColor #F1F5F9
}
start
:Select a coherent goal from accepted scope;
:Identify sources, actors and decisive unknowns;
repeat
  :Elicit needs and analyze conflicts / dependencies;
  :Specify behavior, permissions and data lifecycle;
  :Define acceptance criteria and verification methods;
  :Add scenarios, models and traceability;
  :Verify specification quality and validate user needs;
  :Record findings, questions and dependent gates; <<#49351C>>
repeat while (Blocking ambiguity or further refinement needed?) is (yes) not (no)
if (Actual owner acceptance recorded for this revision?) then (yes)
  :Record accepted content and its limits; <<#173B34>>
else (not yet)
  :Retain candidate status for review; <<#49351C>>
endif
:Maintain links and assess later changes;
stop
legend bottom
Management applies throughout: sources, IDs, states, versions and change control.
Reassess feasibility as evidence changes; unresolved gates block dependent commitments.
This cycle does not establish M-02 acceptance, a product test result or coding authorization.
endlegend
@enduml
